# Calls a method on the RWS interface by name. Keeps the ROS side free of a
# bespoke service per robot operation - make_robot_ready, run_rapid_routine,
# set_speedratio and the rest all come through here.
#
# Only what robot_control/commands.py lists can be called, and params are
# name=value in any order: ['signal_name=DO_1', 'signal_value=1'].
# The command 'help' answers with the whole list.
string command
string[] params
---
bool status
string message
int32 status_code
